    "intro_narrative": "You awaken aboard the derelict Space Station Alpha. Red emergency lights bathe the metallic corridors in an eerie glow, casting long shadows across the walls. The central AI system has locked down the main airlock, and life support systems are rapidly failing. To escape this orbital grave, you must traverse the station's interconnected network of cryptic terminals, abandoned biometric safes, and complex mathematical optimizers. Follow the fragmented data trails left by the former crew, restore power to the consoles, and deduce the correct sequence of inputs to override the final mainframe before the oxygen runs out completely.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
